# Rules to skip for specific paths in this crate.
# Format: RULE/name:path/glob — gitignore-style glob relative to crate root.
# Every entry requires a WHY: comment. No blanket category ignores.

# WHY: semaino exposes `SemainoPipeline`, `AlertPipeline`, `Convergence`,
# `SignalAggregator`, etc. via lib.rs `pub use`. Item-definition files
# (alert.rs, aggregator.rs, convergence.rs, pipeline.rs) must expose
# `pub` for those re-exports. The RUST/pub-visibility rule's lib.rs/mod.rs
# exemption does not follow `pub use` chains into defining files.
RUST/pub-visibility:src/**
